  "editorial": {
    "name": "colorjs/color-rgba",
    "descriptionZh": "把颜色字符串解析成 [r,g,b,a] 数组的库，覆盖 CSS Color 4 的写法：oklch、color(display-p3 …) 与空格斜杠语法都吃。",
    "takeawayZh": "把颜色串解析成 rgba 数组",
    "noteZh": "README 首句是 Convert color string to array with rgba channel values: \"rgba(127,127,127,.1)\" → [127,127,127,.1]，示例把各种写法并排列出：rgba('red') 得 [255, 0, 0, 1]、rgba('hsla(109, 50%, 50%, .75)') 得 [87.125, 191.25, 63.75, .75]、rgba('oklch(0.628 0.258 29.234)') 与 rgba('color(display-p3 1 0 0)') 都得 [255, 0, 0, 1]，还有 `rgb(80 120 160 / 50%)` 这种斜杠写法；正文说底层用 color-space v3，覆盖 CSS Color 4 全部空间。仓库 28 star、67 个 commit、3 branches，没有 release，标 MIT license，Used by 29K。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
